 - **Degenerate Cells**: If fewer than 2 sign-changing edges exist in a cell, no vertex is created [S1, pitfall].
-- **Rank Deficiency**: If normals are coplanar or collinear, the QEF matrix is singular. Use SVD truncation or regularization [S2].
-- **Sharp Features**: Newton projection may degrade edge/corner placement if normals diverge significantly. Detect sharp components using pairwise dot product of normals and skip projection for sharp features [S3].
